</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Corsi-Cabrera</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramos</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Guevara</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Arce</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>EEG oscillations during menstrual cycle</article-title><source>Int J Neurosci</source><year>1994</year><volume>76</volume><fpage>279</fpage><lpage>292</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7960484</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fleck</surname><given-names>KM</given-names></name><name><surname>Polich</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>P300 and the menstrual cycle</article-title><source>Electroencephalogr Clin Neurophysiol</source><year>1988</year><volume>71</volume><fpage>157</fpage><lpage>160</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2449336</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Becker</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Creutzfeldt</surname><given-names>OD</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwibbe</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Wuttke</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Changes in physiological, EEG and psychological parameters in women during the spontaneous menstrual cycle and following oral contraceptives</article-title><source>Psychoneuroendocrinology</source><year>1982</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>75</fpage><lpage>90</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7100370</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Campos</surname><given-names>RG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A quadrature formula for the Hankel transform</article-title><source>Num Algorithms</source><year>1995</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>343</fpage><lpage>354</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Campos</surname><given-names>RG</given-names></name><name><surname>Ju&#x000e1;rez</surname><given-names>LZ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A discretization of the continuous Fourier transform</article-title><source>Nuovo Cimento B</source><year>1992</year><volume>100</volume><fpage>703</fpage><lpage>711</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sol&#x000ed;s-Ortiz</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Corsi-Cabrera</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>EEG pattern of anxiety along the menstrual cycle</article-title><source>Rev Mex Psicol</source><year>2002</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>187</fpage><lpage>195</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Marshall</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Leslie J, De Groot J, Jamenson L</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Hormonal regulation of the menstrual cycle and mechanisms of ovulation</article-title><source>Endocrinology</source><year>2001</year><publisher-name>Philadelphia: W.B. Saunders Company</publisher-name><fpage>2073</fpage><lpage>2085</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Guevera</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramos</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Corsi-Cabrera</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>CAPTUSEN: un sistema para la adquisici&#x000f3;n computarizada del EEG y potenciales relacionados a eventos</article-title><source>Rev Mex Psicol</source><year>2000</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>77</fpage><lpage>88</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Guevera</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramos</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Hern&#x000e1;ndez-Gonz&#x000e1;lez</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Zarabozo</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Corsi-Cabrera</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>POTENCOR; a program to calculate power and correlation spectra of EEG signals</article-title><source>Comput Meth Prog Biomed</source><year>2002</year><volume>72</volume><fpage>241</fpage><lpage>250</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Campos</surname><given-names>RG</given-names></name><name><surname>Dom&#x000ed;nguez Mota</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Coronado</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Quadrature formulas for integrals transforms generated by orthogonal polynomials</article-title><source>arXiv:08052111v1</source><year>2008</year><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.arXiv.org"/></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Camarena-Ibarrola</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Chavez</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Using a new discretization of the Fourier transform to discriminate voiced from unvoiced speech</article-title><source>Proceedings of the Seventh Mexican International Conference on Computer Science</source><year>2006</year><fpage>127</fpage><lpage>134</lpage><comment>doi: 10.1109/ENC.2006.36</comment></citat